  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001"><quote id="quote-00001">The table below shows the populations of three cities during different years. Take a moment to think of at least one thing you notice and one thing you wonder.</quote>
<table class="unnumbered os-raise-wideequaltable" id="table-00001">
  <tgroup cols="7"><tbody><row>
      <entry><emphasis>
        City
     </emphasis> </entry><entry><emphasis>
        1950
